Completeness transforms consistently: $\begin{aligned}
  \mathbf 1
    &=\sum_n \ket{k_n}_{\mathrm{box}}
       {}_{\mathrm{box}}\!\bra{k_n}\\
    &=\sum_n \Delta k\,\ket{k_n}\bra{k_n}
      \longrightarrow
      \int_{-\infty}^{\infty}dk\,\ket k\bra k.
  \end{aligned}$ The rescaling, the delta function, and the replacement of a sum by an integral are three parts of one operation.

